-- Stat block 001: correlation analysis detail for query planner cost model. PostgreSQL uses correlation to estimate random_page_cost impact: high correlation (|corr| → 1.0) means Index Scan is cost-effective even at random_page_cost=4.0; low correlation means Seq Scan may be preferred at default settings. For SSD environments, set random_page_cost=1.1 to encourage index usage. (Source: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-query.html)
